      "title": "Samsung, SK Hynix test Chinese chip tools as hedge against US risks",
      "summary": "SK hynix 관련 기사다. 기사 제목은 'Samsung, SK Hynix test Chinese chip tools as hedge against US risks'이다. The memory chipmakers began testing AMEC etching equipment about two years ago, when ​uncertainty was mounting over whether Washington would continue allowing them to import U. S. chipmaking tools into China, two of the sources said. Samsung said in ​a statement to Reuters that it has not tested AMEC equipment for use at its China factory and had not considered doing so SK Hynix declined to comment Commerce Department designated Samsung and SK Hynix's Chinese factories as \"validated end users\" (VEU) in 2023, allowing imports of certain controlled U STAMP OF APPROVAL For AMEC and China's emerging crop of semiconductor-equipment makers, winning approval from Samsung or SK Hynix would amount to a powerful commercial endorsement AMEC equipment is already used by leading Chinese chipmakers, including NAND producer Yangtze Memory Technologies Co (YMTC), giving Samsung and SK Hynix greater confidence that some systems are mature enough for testing, the sources said. 이 기사는 해당 기업과 연결된 해외 보도를 바탕으로 정리했다.",
